  ["BPS national, 2023–2024","E-commerce value Rp1,100.87tn → Rp1,288.93tn (+17.08 percent); estimated businesses 3,816,750 → 4,400,972 (+15.31 percent)","Aggregate growth reflects broader participation, not only larger activity per business"],
