("P","The core sample can track the wedge across time, Tokopedia provides a clear mechanism case, BPS supplies participant-side evidence outside platform accounts, and PMK/DJP establishes the institutional route from marketplace records to the tax authority. The research question can be answered with data that are available and auditable to source."),

